WEBVTT

00:00:02.020 --> 00:00:07.270
There's Gilfy, with four straight wins since her debut. She's also brought along a lot of fans with her.

00:00:08.480 --> 00:00:14.820
Every one of today's thoroughbreds can trace their pedigree to one of the three foundation sires.

00:00:15.490 --> 00:00:22.710
Gilfy, who traces her roots back to Herod, is a mare that has certainly become the talk of the year.

00:00:22.710 --> 00:00:26.210
The present situation is exactly as I related.

00:00:27.040 --> 00:00:30.630
Will you accept, Mr. Duke Togo.

00:00:34.180 --> 00:00:37.350
Oh my, Matchem's acting up, delaying the race!

00:00:38.970 --> 00:00:43.850
I wanted to handle the situation myself, but if anyone ever found out about it...

00:00:43.850 --> 00:00:46.350
...your lordly name will crash and burn.

00:00:48.360 --> 00:00:51.690
I've encountered several cases similar to yours.

00:00:52.360 --> 00:01:00.120
Still, if people knew that a terrorist had entered your noted family lineage, it would become more than a scandal.

00:01:00.580 --> 00:01:04.210
Don't think of my pedigree as just "noted."

00:01:04.210 --> 00:01:08.210
My lineage is full of people who took up important posts for this country.

00:01:08.840 --> 00:01:13.130
Now that scoundrel is flaunting that
lineage as if he was just granted peerage.

00:01:13.130 --> 00:01:17.140
Please sympathize with this morass I'm in and accept the job.

00:01:31.190 --> 00:01:32.360
And they're off!

00:02:01.220 --> 00:02:03.600
Go Gilfy! Pass them!

00:02:03.600 --> 00:02:05.640
Pass them all!

00:02:07.480 --> 00:02:09.230
The final stretch!

00:02:16.780 --> 00:02:18.280
In just a twinkle, Gilfy's-

00:02:18.280 --> 00:02:19.910
Go! Go!

00:02:25.290 --> 00:02:26.410
<i>Hmm?</i>

00:02:32.460 --> 00:02:33.090
It's a sniping.

00:02:33.090 --> 00:02:34.210
A what?

00:02:37.760 --> 00:02:42.930
I walk unsteadily on paths to nowhere

00:02:43.140 --> 00:02:47.060
wondering what I should do right now.

00:02:48.560 --> 00:02:53.520
I play the song you like on the car stereo

00:02:53.690 --> 00:02:58.070
with the volume up and my feelings crystallized

00:02:58.070 --> 00:03:03.700
driving on streets with no crossroads or signals

00:03:03.910 --> 00:03:09.120
with a speed that will catch up with you.

00:03:09.460 --> 00:03:13.580
So faraway - let's run!

00:03:13.920 --> 00:03:19.880
And let's not bother with the breaks - full throttle.

00:03:20.170 --> 00:03:24.180
Oh someday - one of these days

00:03:24.390 --> 00:03:29.270
You'll be at my place where nobody can find you.

00:03:29.850 --> 00:03:35.360
Whenever you suffer a breakdown one can't see

00:03:35.610 --> 00:03:40.950
depend on me for your repairs.

00:03:41.200 --> 00:03:45.320
So faraway - let's run!

00:03:45.530 --> 00:03:51.540
We'll reset and start again - even at our limit.

00:03:51.750 --> 00:03:55.840
Oh someday - one of these days

00:03:56.040 --> 00:04:01.880
If I'm with you we'll find our dream.

00:04:07.600 --> 00:04:12.060
The Law of Pedigree

00:04:12.690 --> 00:04:16.610
Even with her jockey accidentally falling off at the finish line

00:04:16.610 --> 00:04:19.070
Gilfy still remains the winner!

00:04:25.820 --> 00:04:29.040
Gilfy, true to her fame, has won the G1 by a large margin!

00:04:29.490 --> 00:04:32.960
How many wins in a row will she achieve?

00:04:34.420 --> 00:04:36.130
I will accept the job.

00:04:37.000 --> 00:04:39.090
Give me three days.

00:04:40.000 --> 00:04:41.420
You'll be sniping?

00:04:55.440 --> 00:04:56.310
Gilfy.

00:05:00.690 --> 00:05:02.690
Gilfy, I'm sorry.

00:05:09.450 --> 00:05:15.120
Celia, why did you purposely miss, and let her win on top of it?

00:05:15.120 --> 00:05:16.460
Uncle...

00:05:16.460 --> 00:05:20.210
Shells, the runner-up, was in the way. So my timing...

00:05:20.210 --> 00:05:26.970
We cannot continue having a horse with impure blood winning the storied Classic Races.

00:05:27.470 --> 00:05:29.680
But that's not her fault!

00:05:29.680 --> 00:05:34.680
Yes. My brother - your father - falsified her pedigree certificate.

00:05:35.770 --> 00:05:36.980
Well...

00:05:36.980 --> 00:05:42.190
Because of that, a non-thoroughbred horse was allowed in the races.

00:05:42.190 --> 00:05:46.990
I will not be held responsible for his sins- not if I can help it!

00:05:46.990 --> 00:05:48.450
I understand.

00:05:48.870 --> 00:05:53.740
Your social status, and the fact
that you chair the Jockey Club...

00:05:53.740 --> 00:05:57.920
...I know full well the responsibilities you bear.

00:05:58.750 --> 00:06:00.420
That I do.

00:06:00.420 --> 00:06:04.760
Then you must know full well why I must eliminate Gilfy.

00:06:04.760 --> 00:06:09.930
I won't tell anyone this secret. But for you to kill her...

00:06:09.930 --> 00:06:14.020
You don't know the importance of preserving a pedigree!

00:06:14.020 --> 00:06:16.770
They're called "thoroughbreds" because of their pedigrees are maintained!

00:06:17.230 --> 00:06:19.940
Gilfy is a horse that was born to race!

00:06:19.940 --> 00:06:22.770
I've raised her myself, so I know!

00:06:23.320 --> 00:06:24.690
Be reasonable!

00:06:24.690 --> 00:06:29.410
I thought that you should be the one to put her to sleep since you raised her.

00:06:29.910 --> 00:06:31.570
But I guess I was wrong.

00:06:31.570 --> 00:06:34.410
Stop this, Uncle! Don't kill Gilfy!

00:06:36.000 --> 00:06:39.710
Celia... I cannot allow this to continue any longer!

00:06:39.710 --> 00:06:42.790
If that's how you'll be, then I'll have to rely on a pro.

00:07:20.750 --> 00:07:21.290
Whoa!

00:08:14.430 --> 00:08:15.260
Hey!

00:08:15.720 --> 00:08:17.720
Where are you taking that feed bucket?

00:08:17.720 --> 00:08:20.220
This stable is now off limits!

00:08:52.050 --> 00:08:54.050
What did you put in that feed?

00:08:55.340 --> 00:08:56.050
Wait!

00:08:56.050 --> 00:09:00.310
Let me guess. Someone asked you to do it, right?

00:09:00.310 --> 00:09:02.730
If you try to kill Gilfy again...

00:09:03.140 --> 00:09:04.810
...I'll shoot you in the heart!

00:09:06.230 --> 00:09:07.560
S-Settle down!

00:09:12.650 --> 00:09:13.570
Wait!

00:09:24.870 --> 00:09:25.460
Gilfy!

00:09:26.370 --> 00:09:28.170
Whoa there, Gilfy!

00:09:43.930 --> 00:09:45.390
There, you see?

00:09:45.940 --> 00:09:47.270
I'll protect you.

00:09:47.270 --> 00:09:49.360
I will always protect you.

00:09:49.360 --> 00:09:52.860
Forget your excuses! Go bugger off someplace I can't find you!

00:10:02.620 --> 00:10:05.790
This is it. Down to my last card.

00:10:15.970 --> 00:10:18.630
Is this Middleton? Thank heavens!

00:10:19.680 --> 00:10:21.220
What do you want now?

00:10:21.220 --> 00:10:25.850
I was just on my way to grab a pint at a pub. Can't we do this tomorrow?

00:10:26.310 --> 00:10:27.560
Actually...

00:10:30.020 --> 00:10:32.860
What? You need a referral to a hit man?!

00:10:34.360 --> 00:10:35.650
Are you serious?

00:10:37.190 --> 00:10:38.150
Uh-huh.

00:10:38.150 --> 00:10:40.360
Sure... understood.

00:10:40.360 --> 00:10:41.990
I'll see if I can arrange it.

00:10:46.080 --> 00:10:50.170
It seems something's about to occur at the Classic Races.

00:11:33.540 --> 00:11:36.210
Mr. Duke Togo.

00:11:36.210 --> 00:11:39.550
I am Gideon de Gray.

00:11:39.970 --> 00:11:41.630
State your business.

00:11:42.800 --> 00:11:48.310
I want you to eliminate Gilfy who will enter the G1 race tomorrow.

00:11:48.310 --> 00:11:53.310
So the chair of the Jockey Club wants me to shoot a registered race horse?

00:11:55.730 --> 00:11:58.690
So you were the one who shot the bridle?

00:11:59.940 --> 00:12:01.570
You noticed?

00:12:03.990 --> 00:12:07.950
Yes, I certainly had my niece do that.

00:12:07.950 --> 00:12:10.830
But she was unable to kill her.

00:12:11.410 --> 00:12:14.080
Are there conditions to the killing?

00:12:14.080 --> 00:12:20.340
If you can, I want you to shoot her near the finish line if there's a chance she might win.

00:12:21.050 --> 00:12:22.220
The reason?

00:12:22.220 --> 00:12:25.840
My niece Celia is trying to obstruct the killing.

00:12:25.840 --> 00:12:28.720
If you try to kill Gilfy before tomorrow...

00:12:28.720 --> 00:12:32.810
...you and Celia will definitely run into each other.

00:12:34.140 --> 00:12:38.650
Obviously, I don't want her to face off with you.

00:12:38.650 --> 00:12:42.900
However, I know she will come after you with fangs bared.

00:12:42.900 --> 00:12:44.740
I want to avoid that.

00:12:44.740 --> 00:12:48.160
I don't want her to die in that fashion.

00:12:49.240 --> 00:12:50.290
Understood.

00:12:50.830 --> 00:12:56.630
Once the $3 million is deposited in the designated Swiss Bank account, I will take the job.

00:12:56.630 --> 00:12:58.130
Thank you.

00:12:58.130 --> 00:13:02.380
I promise you the money will be in the account by 12:00 tonight.

00:13:19.190 --> 00:13:20.190
Gilfy.

00:13:21.070 --> 00:13:24.280
I <i>will</i>  protect you.

00:13:25.820 --> 00:13:27.450
Celia, you mustn't!

00:13:28.160 --> 00:13:30.780
Sorry, I tried to stop her...

00:13:31.370 --> 00:13:33.660
It's fine. Take your leave.

00:13:39.500 --> 00:13:40.540
Last night...

00:13:40.920 --> 00:13:44.420
...Gilfy was attacked and the stable burned down.

00:13:47.130 --> 00:13:52.060
Gilfy will enter that race, no matter how many times I get in your way!

00:13:52.060 --> 00:13:53.600
Will you be reasonable?

00:13:54.730 --> 00:13:58.600
I don't want to see you in any danger.

00:13:58.600 --> 00:14:01.480
So you finally hired a pro?

00:14:01.480 --> 00:14:03.610
Who exactly is this pro?

00:14:05.190 --> 00:14:06.610
And if you find out?

00:14:07.200 --> 00:14:08.950
I will shoot him down.

00:14:08.950 --> 00:14:12.280
So please, Uncle, tell me who he is!

00:14:13.870 --> 00:14:17.120
I cannot answer that, so walk away, Celia!

00:14:17.960 --> 00:14:20.170
Don't you dare get involved!

00:14:20.170 --> 00:14:23.000
This is my last warning to you!

00:14:23.000 --> 00:14:24.250
Uncle...

00:14:24.250 --> 00:14:28.130
You'll be facing a pro! You'll never win against him!

00:14:28.550 --> 00:14:32.140
I will lay down my life protecting Gilfy.

00:14:32.930 --> 00:14:34.430
Your life?

00:14:34.430 --> 00:14:36.640
So you're willing to die for Gilfy?

00:14:37.480 --> 00:14:38.980
Yes I am.

00:14:41.060 --> 00:14:42.360
Very well.

00:14:42.360 --> 00:14:46.030
If you're putting that much on the line for her...

00:14:46.860 --> 00:14:49.240
...I'll put my life on the line as well.

00:14:49.240 --> 00:14:50.910
You're betting your life?

00:14:52.070 --> 00:14:56.950
The man I hired never forgives a client that goes behind his back.

00:14:56.950 --> 00:14:59.210
If he knows about this...

00:14:59.870 --> 00:15:02.420
...he will come and kill me.

00:15:02.960 --> 00:15:05.050
The name of the pro is Duke Togo.

00:15:05.460 --> 00:15:08.010
Code name: Golgo 13.

00:15:08.010 --> 00:15:11.930
He's a world famous sniper at the very top of his game.

00:15:12.510 --> 00:15:14.140
Duke Togo.

00:15:50.920 --> 00:15:52.680
Master Duke Togo, right?

00:15:53.140 --> 00:15:56.050
A Miss Celia Arbing wishes to meet with you.

00:15:56.470 --> 00:15:57.970
Turn her away.

00:15:57.970 --> 00:15:59.140
But sir...

00:16:27.210 --> 00:16:29.550
You're Mr. Duke Togo, am I right?

00:16:32.630 --> 00:16:34.680
I'm Celia Arbing.

00:16:34.680 --> 00:16:39.060
It helped that you're lodging here under the name "Duke Togo."

00:16:39.060 --> 00:16:42.770
I was able to look up where you
were staying without any problem.

00:16:49.690 --> 00:16:52.070
This is £1.5 million.

00:16:52.070 --> 00:16:54.910
This is the Arbingses entire fortune.

00:16:54.910 --> 00:16:57.700
I don't know how much my uncle paid you.

00:16:57.700 --> 00:17:00.700
But please take this and cancel your job.

00:17:00.700 --> 00:17:05.040
I'm sorry, but I don't know what you're talking about.

00:17:05.540 --> 00:17:06.710
Now leave.

00:17:07.250 --> 00:17:08.460
I'm begging you!

00:17:10.960 --> 00:17:12.010
Please!

00:17:12.010 --> 00:17:14.550
Spare Gilfy! Don't kill her!

00:17:14.550 --> 00:17:20.180
For someone who has made horses her life, a horse is more valuable than any human!

00:17:20.180 --> 00:17:22.560
So please, walk away!

00:17:22.980 --> 00:17:27.980
Like I said, I don't know what you're talking about.

00:17:30.730 --> 00:17:32.280
Now leave.

00:17:38.070 --> 00:17:39.580
If it's not money you want...

00:18:19.160 --> 00:18:20.320
Too bad.

00:18:21.620 --> 00:18:27.580
But before you take your aim at Gilfy, my Remington will find you first.

00:18:28.580 --> 00:18:32.250
I advise you to look up the shooting skills of the enemy you just made.

00:18:34.670 --> 00:18:37.420
I won't lose. I will not lose to him.

00:18:41.140 --> 00:18:44.350
The highly anticipated race for all derby fans is about to begin.

00:18:45.680 --> 00:18:50.190
The favorite this time around is the one and only Gilfy!

00:18:57.440 --> 00:18:58.450
Gilfy.

00:18:59.700 --> 00:19:02.950
Golgo has got to be around here somewhere.

00:19:03.660 --> 00:19:08.870
Shooting a bullet from outside the grounds would be impossible.

00:19:15.500 --> 00:19:16.380
Where?

00:19:16.880 --> 00:19:18.050
Where are you?

00:19:33.480 --> 00:19:37.480
The gates are open, and the race has started without a hitch!

00:19:38.150 --> 00:19:38.990
Where?

00:19:45.160 --> 00:19:45.950
Where?

00:19:46.910 --> 00:19:48.040
Where are you?

00:19:49.410 --> 00:19:53.000
Gilfy the star is in fourth, gaining steadily.

00:19:53.000 --> 00:19:53.920
Hurry...

00:19:53.920 --> 00:19:58.420
If I don't hurry up and find out where Golgo 13 is...

00:19:58.420 --> 00:20:01.430
Gilfy's coming up! Gilfy has pulled up!

00:20:01.430 --> 00:20:04.930
Has Gilfy really cut into Hampton's lead?

00:20:04.930 --> 00:20:08.430
Where? Where are you, Golgo 13?!

00:20:08.430 --> 00:20:10.430
Don't tell me you're outside!

00:20:13.730 --> 00:20:15.310
I-Impossible!

00:20:16.020 --> 00:20:16.820
It can't-

00:20:28.700 --> 00:20:30.700
Gilfy's in the lead! Gilfy's in the lead!

00:20:30.700 --> 00:20:33.460
It's Gilfy by a head!

00:20:52.060 --> 00:20:53.140
<i>He did it!</i>

00:21:01.320 --> 00:21:07.320
<i>If Golgo 13 managed to carry out the job, then that means Celia...</i>

00:21:10.200 --> 00:21:13.790
<i>Nothing less from Golgo 13 to shoot out the bit.</i>

00:21:14.330 --> 00:21:20.050
<i>Gilfy then bit off her tongue, choked on it, and died instantly from suffocation.</i>

00:21:20.800 --> 00:21:25.840
<i>This leaves me with just a few trace evidence to get rid of.</i>

00:21:33.310 --> 00:21:38.100
<i>I have now made my recompense, but at a great cost.</i>

00:21:38.100 --> 00:21:41.070
<i>Of both my life and Celia's.</i>

00:21:42.190 --> 00:21:43.860
Golgo 13!

00:21:45.860 --> 00:21:48.070
We were supposed to be...

00:21:48.070 --> 00:21:51.870
...the only ones who knew about our deal and about my job.

00:21:52.370 --> 00:21:54.370
Care to explain?

00:21:54.910 --> 00:21:57.330
There's no explanation.

00:21:57.330 --> 00:21:59.380
I was the one who told Celia.

00:22:40.670 --> 00:22:45.800
I enjoyed the little things.

00:22:47.840 --> 00:22:53.010
I loved when you gave me a flower every day

00:22:53.760 --> 00:22:59.100
instead of just one big bouquet

00:22:59.810 --> 00:23:03.940
of flowers.

00:23:06.030 --> 00:23:11.570
It was like a romance novel.

00:23:12.200 --> 00:23:16.160
Surely someday... just kidding.

00:23:16.490 --> 00:23:19.540
I had a dream.

00:23:19.920 --> 00:23:25.250
Your face shined eternally.

00:23:26.090 --> 00:23:31.840
Because I think of you all the time.

00:23:32.260 --> 00:23:37.390
I'm sorry, but on a lonely night like this

00:23:38.350 --> 00:23:43.900
I'm remembering you, but

00:23:44.190 --> 00:23:48.490
I won't cry like I did that day.

00:23:50.240 --> 00:23:51.660
I won't.

00:24:02.830 --> 00:24:07.920
Berne is controlling a beautiful, captivating
woman named Madam Martin behind the scenes.

00:24:07.920 --> 00:24:12.130
A man jealous of Berne has hired Golgo to go kill him.

00:24:12.130 --> 00:24:20.980
Golgo then begins his surveillance of Madam in Monaco, but Berne's unexpected true form will come to light.

00:24:20.980 --> 00:24:24.690
Next time on Golgo 13: Expired Fineries.

00:24:21.310 --> 00:24:27.110
Expired Fineries

00:24:24.690 --> 00:24:28.780
Don't stand behind him, if you value your life.
